s: </bold>There are two pending patent applications, one for amplification method and the other is for anlaysis algorithm, that are related to this manusccipt.</p></fn><fn fn-type="financial-disclosure"><p><bold>Funding: </bold>The funding for this research is provided by the NRL base program and the Office of Naval Research. This project would not be possible without the support from the Air Force Surgeon General Office, the Joint Program Executive Office and Defense Threat Reduction Agency during the Silent Guardian Demonstration Project.</p></fn></fn-group></back></article>